Z||000000||MrPBody||12-31-2001||06:39 PM||||Clutch hydraulic problems have been so popular lately!  For everyone who is looking for info, but doesn't want to dig through all the search results, here are a few recent threads:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016441.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016441.html</A>  -- Formula88 and LZeitgeist have a clutch problem<BR><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016622.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016622.html</A>  -- LZeitgeist's solution (bleed screw)<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016213.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016213.html</A>  -- Rodney's adjustable clutch banjo<P><BR><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014719.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014719.html</A>  -- MrPBody's clutch gremlins <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015204.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015204.html</A>  -- MrPBody's adjustable pushrod<P><BR><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015114.html" TARGET=_blank> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015114.html</A>" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015114.html[/URL]</A>   -- SLYGUY's hydraulics<BR> <P><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015323.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015323.html</A>  -- 88Style's slave cylinder<BR> <P><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014183.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014183.html</A>  -- RussB's hydraulics<BR> <P><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015677.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/015677.html</A>  -- Wrench's homebuilt pressure bleeder<P> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014568.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014568.html</A>  -- FieroMaster88's clutch pedal<BR> <P><A HREF="htt